{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a5e59aa9dc5a833d951c","chatId":"460be1aa998a4c4e800647ad9afc1005","sessionId":null,"userId":98969,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"E\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"D\"\n}","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"E\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"D\"\n}","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1761,"promptTokens":424,"completionTokens":147,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:41:25"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.009703638100787755,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a5e59aa9dc5a833d951b","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794483685538,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:41:25","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a5e59aa9dc5a833d951b","chatId":"460be1aa998a4c4e800647ad9afc1005","sessionId":null,"userId":98969,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n小娜是一个十岁的孩子。有一天，因为她生病了，父母带她去看医生。检查后，医生把父母叫到一边，告诉他们小娜得了很难治愈的重病。然而，父母却告诉小娜她很好，可以像其他孩子一样长大并过上正常的生活。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，小娜最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 悲观\nB) 紧张\nC) 绝望\nD) 悲痛\nE) 充满希望\nF) 释怀\n\n## 问题 2\n小娜为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 她意识到自己的病并不严重\nB) 她意识到自己的病情非常严重\nC) 她意识到她的父母再也不用担心了\nD) 她有机会治愈并回到正常的生活","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.009703638100787755,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a5e59aa9dc5a833d951c","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794483685535,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:41:25","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"e3763bbf076846a38f7a7aff71d3c5cf"}